    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12442546/comment/12786458",
          "id": "12786458",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150"
            },
            "displayName": "Robert Muir",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "patch for the bug that:\n* for Turkish language, when Version >= 3.1, use TurkishLowerCaseFilter instead in SnowballAnalyzer\n* Add javadoc note to SnowballFilter noting that it expects lowercased text to work (and in the turkish case, you must use the special filter)\n* add contrib/analyzers dependency to contrib/snowball (perhaps not the best but what is the other option?)\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150"
            },
            "displayName": "Robert Muir",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2009-12-05T18:10:46.479+0000",
          "updated": "2009-12-05T18:10:46.479+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12442546/comment/12786515",
          "id": "12786515",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=simonw",
            "name": "simonw",
            "key": "simonw",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Simon Willnauer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Robert, the patch looks almost good. You should also change the pom.xml.template to reflect the new dependency. I'm still thinking about moving snowball into analyzers as a analyzers/snowball would that make sense?\n\nSomewhat unrelated but still ugly:\n{code}\n      Class<?> stemClass = Class.forName(\"org.tartarus.snowball.ext.\" + name + \"Stemmer\");\n{code}\nWhen I look through the patch I see this \"name\" parameter which is used to load a stemmer per reflection. We should really define a factory interface that creates the stemmer and get rid of the refelction code",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=simonw",
            "name": "simonw",
            "key": "simonw",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Simon Willnauer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2009-12-05T21:51:28.853+0000",
          "updated": "2009-12-05T21:51:28.853+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12442546/comment/12786517",
          "id": "12786517",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
